{"sequence":2,"at":"2026-09-26T17:04:17.383Z","kind":"response","attemptId":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","attempt":{"id":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","status":"response","startedAt":"2026-09-26T17:03:51.636Z","request":{"messageCount":1,"messageCharacters":48234,"toolNames":["submit_authorization_result"],"toolChoice":{"name":"submit_authorization_result"},"maxTokens":6000,"temperature":0,"executableTools":false,"toolSchemas":[{"type":"object","properties":{"results":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"obligationId":{"type":"string"},"conclusion":{"type":"string","enum":["source_supported_failure","source_refuted","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["entry","binding","control","effect","condition"]},"statement":{"type":"string"},"citations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"sourceId":{"type":"string"},"startLine":{"type":"number"},"endLine":{"type":"number"}},"required":["sourceId","startLine","endLine"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["id","kind","statement","citations"],"additionalProperties":false}},"decisiveMissingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"suggestedObservations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["obligationId","conclusion","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":11601,"output":830,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_WxtUx7sNuAowLkuXvMjBiGeO","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Aassessment::entry%3Atarget","conclusion":"source_refuted","explanation":"The fixed source enforces the declared expectation for the stated case: the actual decision is deny. The route maps POST bookmarks/shared/action to shared_action, which invokes handle_action; with only remove present, dispatch reaches remove. remove resolves the bookmark through bookmark_write, whose query requires owner=request.user and raises Http404 when that owner binding is absent. Therefore the non-owner relation prevents the protected delete call from being reached, even though the bookmark is shared. Sharing-related read access is not a deletion grant here: the supplied shared-action path uses the owner-only write binding, and the shared view itself does not establish ownership. The caller's authentication, ordinary-user role, bookmark sharing/settings, POST contents, CSRF/infrastructure success, and framework behavior are task assumptions; the source-backed authorization facts are the route, dispatch, owner binding, and delete effect. No decisive external fact is missing for this bounded reachability assessment; repository-wide completeness, deployment behavior, and exact HTTP response details are not claimed.","facts":[{"id":"entry_shared_action","kind":"entry","statement":"The shared-action URL is routed to the shared_action view.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a51fad5856e205e8","startLine":35,"endLine":39}]},{"id":"entry_remove_dispatch","kind":"entry","statement":"The shared_action view delegates to handle_action, and a remove POST field dispatches to remove with the submitted bookmark identifier.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-b082ceda16e389bc","startLine":346,"endLine":358},{"sourceId":"src-b082ceda16e389bc","startLine":361,"endLine":368}]},{"id":"identity_resource_owner_binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The write accessor selects a bookmark only when its owner equals the authenticated request user; otherwise it raises Http404.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-8eccbcbd2d3dd02b","startLine":28,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"strongest_authorization_control","kind":"control","statement":"The decisive visible authorization control is the owner=request.user predicate in bookmark_write, rather than the bookmark's shared status.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-8eccbcbd2d3dd02b","startLine":28,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"protected_delete_effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the write accessor succeeds, remove deletes the resolved bookmark.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-b082ceda16e389bc","startLine":255,"endLine":258}]},{"id":"nonowner_denial_condition","kind":"condition","statement":"For a caller who is not the bookmark owner, the owner-filtered write lookup cannot resolve that bookmark, so the delete operation is not reached.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-8eccbcbd2d3dd02b","startLine":28,"endLine":32},{"sourceId":"src-b082ceda16e389bc","startLine":255,"endLine":258}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":11601,"output":830,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":25740.6852,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-26T17:04:17.382Z"}}
